      "comment": "Smart three year-old YOTTIE (1) makes his first appearance since he was beaten just over a metre into third in July's Queensland Derby. Has won four of six tries here and was readied with a trial win. He'll be hard to stop from the inside draw. A TRUE LOVE (5) has done a good job to finish fourth in her last two outings at Menangle, last time coming from wider to be beaten only 2.2 metres. Had this barrier when she won here last month. SHAZADELE (3) is racing well and draws lower than when she added to a string of top-four results by working but sticking on for third last time. DIVINE GIRL (6) hasn't been too far off the placings of late and owns a handy record here.",
